      "@type": "ClusterType",
      "@id": "sdc4:mc-j4t6xb94355k51xg87n8awdl",
      "label": "Education Governed Record",
      "description": "Root data cluster (DMType Item) for a governed education record in CordovaOS: a student's enrollment and academic history. Wraps the domain's data components with the shared W3C PROV-O Provenance cluster so each record carries its lineage bound alongside its data. Workflow, attestation, parties, and the system audit trail sit in the DMType's native governance slots; access control and retention apply as bound sdcgovernance policy.",
